+---
+id: task-001-rental-module-equipment-quote-book
+type: task
+title: "Rental module: equipment, quote, book"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+# Request
+
+Export `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`: an in-memory rental service with
+`addEquipment({id, kind: 'board'|'sail', dailyPrice})`, `quote({itemId, start, end})` and
+`book({itemId, start, end})`. `quote` and `book` throw on unknown item or disallowed period;
+`book` also throws if the item is not free for the whole period.
+
+School rules: money is integer euro cents; times are UTC ISO-8601; periods are whole days
+(midnight UTC to midnight UTC, end exclusive); no overlapping bookings of one item; cancellation
+policy (no refund under 24h before start, else full refund) is NOT implemented yet.
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- Quote total = days x dailyPrice, in integer cents.
+- Invalid periods (not midnight UTC, end <= start, malformed) rejected.
+- Overlapping bookings of the same item rejected; adjacent ones allowed.
+- Tests under `node --test`.
